# KMP Core Rules

## Code Strategy
- Default to business logic, viewmodels, and state in `commonMain`.
- Use expect/actual pattern ONLY when platform APIs (iOS/Android native) are strictly required.
- Do not duplicate common logic into platform-specific modules (`androidMain` or `iosMain`).

## Token & Output Efficiency
- Output ONLY modified functions, concise diffs, or code snippets—never rewrite entire multi-line files.
- Omit conversational filler, explanations of basic Kotlin/Swift syntax, and redundant comments.